[thin] These 1.027–2.000 mm local readings belong to the actual rigid tip's front/outlet passage shell, outside the snap groove: the minimum maps to native X 6.784/S 2.348/N 10.100. The frozen crop changes only the rear S 55 plane and preserves radial stock, source passages and full groove. Baked RX -105° manufacturing and current 0.20 first/0.24 body recipe retain automatic tree supports. This authentic local shell section is not qualified for appliance load or repeated reference handling.
